{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41649","headline":"钱塘对酒曲 · 陈陶","name":"钱塘对酒曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风天鴈悲西陵愁，使君红旗弄涛头。\n东海神鱼骑未得，江天大笑闲悠悠。\n嵯峨吴山莫夸碧，河阳经年一宵白。\n南州彩凤爲君生，古狱愁蛇待恩泽。\n三清羽童来何迟，十二玉楼胡蝶飞。\n炎荒翡翠九门去，辽东白鹤无归期。\n鸱夷公子休悲悄，六鳌如镜天始老。\n尊前事去月团圆，琥珀无情忆苏小。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41649.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41649","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}